{
  "name": "chores-model",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "description": "The semantic model of chores, slice 1: rhythm engine (calendar, cadence, quota over one Monday-anchored week), turn lifecycle (emitted, done, skipped, through assignment), and the charter wall — re-erected here as an invariant after the app traded its coded wall for prose. A small abstract instance (2 members, 3 chores, 7 days), on purpose: its size is a journaled hypothesis, its four invariants are what model/prove settles exhaustively, and its event-kinds are the one span list the instrumentation emits. Governance/redeal is slice 2; fairness convergence is slice 3; both are ledger debts.",
  "publisher": "poietic.studio",
  "requires": [
    {
      "name": "semantic-model",
      "version": "0.1.1",
      "sha256": "7fc53dbba504b0dbee2174433281614817f1843b5ecf4cffacf3db919193093a"
    }
  ],
